ARCHIVE -- HISTORY OF THE SUNAGAKURE-KONOHAGAKURE ALLIANCE

For the record of the diplomatic corps. The bond between the Hidden Sand and
the Hidden Leaf has passed through betrayal into a stronger peace.

Phases of record:
1. Old cooperation -- Sand and Leaf held a longstanding partnership, the Sand
   trading on its wind and puppet arts.
2. The rupture -- Suffering under reduced Daimyo funding, the Fourth Kazekage's
   Sunagakure was drawn into secret alliance with Orochimaru's Otogakure and
   joined the assault on Konoha. The plot collapsed when Orochimaru's murder of
   the Fourth Kazekage was exposed.
3. Reconciliation -- In the aftermath, and decisively during the rescue of Lord
   Gaara from the Akatsuki, the two villages rebuilt trust. Konoha shinobi
   crossed the desert to recover the Sand's own Kazekage.
4. Present -- The alliance is now the cornerstone of Sunagakure policy under the
   Fifth Kazekage.

May this record remind future shinobi that the alliance was bought with hard
lessons. Filed to archive.
